tasks.description:
创建项目目录结构与所有基础文件。工作区：当前目录下创建 polymarket-trader/ 项目。

1. 目录结构：
  polymarket-trader/
    backend/{main.py, config.py, api/{routes.py, ws.py}, core/{polymarket_client.py, wallet_monitor.py, leaderboard.py, order_executor.py}, strategies/{base.py, pipeline.py, mirror.py, proportional.py, fixed_amount.py, price_offset.py, delayed.py, market_filter.py, size_filter.py, reverse.py, position_cap.py, stop_loss.py}, models/schemas.py, store/state.py}
    frontend/{index.html, css/style.css, js/{app.js, ws.js, api.js, panels/{dashboard.js, wallets.js, trades.js, strategies.js, execution.js, settings.js}}}
    requirements.txt, config.example.yaml, .env.example, README.md, run.py

2. requirements.txt：fastapi, uvicorn[standard], httpx, pydantic>=2, pyyaml, websockets, aiofiles, py-clob-client, sqlite3(标准库)

3. backend/config.py：用 Pydantic Settings 管理配置，支持从 YAML + 环境变量加载。配置项：proxy(可选 http/https 代理), polymarket credentials(api_key, api_secret, api_passphrase, wallet_address, private_key — 可选，真实跟单用), monitor 轮询间隔(默认15s), risk 参数(单笔最大金额, 单市场最大仓位, 日最大交易数), executor 模式(paper/live), server 端口(默认8765)

4. backend/models/schemas.py：Pydantic v2 数据模型：
  - WalletWatch: address, alias, enabled, added_at, last_checked, trade_count
  - TradeEvent: wallet, condition_id, token_id, market_slug, market_title, side(BUY/SELL), price, size, timestamp, tx_hash, asset_id
  - StrategyType(enum): MIRROR, PROPORTIONAL, FIXED_AMOUNT, PRICE_OFFSET, DELAYED, MARKET_FILTER, SIZE_FILTER, REVERSE, POSITION_CAP, STOP_LOSS
  - StrategyCategory(enum): FILTER, TRANSFORM, RISK, EXECUTION
  - StrategyConfig: id, type, category, name, description, enabled, params(dict), display_order
  - StrategyPipeline: id, name, strategies(list[StrategyConfig]), enabled, target_wallets(list)
  - FollowSignal: source_trade(TradeEvent), pipeline_id, market(condition_id, token_id, slug, title), side, price, size, strategy_chain(list[str]), created_at, signal_id
  - ExecutionRecord: signal_id, status(PENDING/FILLED/PARTIAL/FAILED/CANCELLED), order_id, fill_price, fill_size, pnl, mode(PAPER/LIVE), timestamp, error
  - LeaderboardEntry: rank, wallet, pnl, volume, markets_traded
  - DashboardStats: watched_wallets, today_trades, today_signals, today_executions, total_pnl

5. 前后端 API 契约（写到 README 或单独 docs/api-contract.md）：
  REST 端点：
    GET  /api/wallets → list[WalletWatch]
    POST /api/wallets {address, alias} → WalletWatch
    DELETE /api/wallets/{address}
    POST /api/wallets/{address}/toggle
    GET  /api/leaderboard?window=week&limit=20 → list[LeaderboardEntry]
    POST /api/wallets/import-leaderboard {wallets: list, aliases: list}
    GET  /api/pipelines → list[StrategyPipeline]
    POST /api/pipelines {name} → StrategyPipeline
    PUT  /api/pipelines/{id} {strategies, enabled, target_wallets}
    DELETE /api/pipelines/{id}
    GET  /api/strategies/available → list[策略类型+参数schema描述]
    GET  /api/trades?wallet=&limit=50 → list[TradeEvent]
    GET  /api/executions?limit=50 → list[ExecutionRecord]
    GET  /api/stats → DashboardStats
    GET  /api/config → 配置(脱敏)
    PUT  /api/config {proxy, risk, monitor_interval, ...}
    POST  /api/executor/mode {mode: paper|live}
    POST  /api/executor/credentials {api_key, api_secret, api_passphrase, wallet_address, private_key}
  WebSocket /ws：服务端推送 JSON 消息：
    {type: "trade_update", data: TradeEvent}
    {type: "signal_generated", data: FollowSignal}
    {type: "execution_update", data: ExecutionRecord}
    {type: "wallet_status", data: {address, status, last_checked, trade_count}}
    {type: "stats_update", data: DashboardStats}
    客户端可发 {type: "subscribe", channels: [...]}

6. backend/store/state.py：SQLite 状态存储骨架（用 aiosqlite 或标准 sqlite3 + 线程池），表：wallets, trades, signals, executions, pipelines, config。提供 async CRUD 方法签名（具体实现可在本任务完成基本表创建和钱包/pipeline 的 CRUD）。

7. config.example.yaml 和 .env.example：示例配置。

验收：目录结构完整，所有文件创建，schemas.py 可被 import 无报错，API 契约文档清晰。
